  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian assistance Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian food assistance in Nigeria.

Impact: Save lives, alleviate suffering and protect human dignity in humanitarian crises  

Outcome 1: People facing acute food insecurity and malnutrition have their needs met in line with humanitarian principles. 
Activites include food assistance, food related NFIs, screening of malnutrition, information of nutrition and infant feeding.</narrative>
  </description>
